---
import { ROUTES } from '../../utils/path';
import { FAQ_URL, SUPPORT_URL } from '../../config/siteConfig';
---

<section class="border-t border-border bg-muted/10 py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="reviews-trust-title">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center">
    <h2 id="reviews-trust-title" class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">
      How we handle customer feedback
    </h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-left text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      <li>
        <strong class="text-foreground">Source:</strong> Reviews come from customers who submit feedback after purchase or
        support interactions. They are not copied from third-party sites.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-foreground">Verification:</strong> A “Verified purchase” badge is shown only when our checkout
        records confirm the order. Without a backend connection, new submissions stay unpublished until moderated.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-foreground">Moderation:</strong> We remove spam, personal data, and content that violates our
        terms. Critical reviews remain when they describe a real experience.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-foreground">Support:</strong> Questions about an order or license should go through{' '}
        <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href={SUPPORT_URL}>
          support
        </a>{' '}
        or the{' '}
        <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href={FAQ_URL}>
          FAQ
        </a>
        —not public reviews.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
      robruncheat.org is an independent retailer and is not affiliated with ROB RUN Entertainment or Electronic Arts.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
      <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href={ROUTES.forum}>
        Prefer community discussion?
      </a>{' '}
      Forum threads are separate from verified customer reviews.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
